  "body": "* 6697: IRC over TLS. Chrome restricted this in https://bugs.chromium.org/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=676951 (sorry we didn't file a bug at that time).\r\n\r\n* 9100: Printers! We already restrict LDP (port 515), and Chrome plans to restrict this printer port in https://bugs.chromium.org/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=687530#c8.\r\n\r\n@bzbarsky, @teddink, @johnwilander: Would y'all be interested in making similar changes to your respective bad ports lists?\r\n\r\n_(@hannob noted that I misread some things about IPP. I no longer wish to block port 631, as it's actually completely normal for CUPS to serve it's web interface over that port. I've updated the above accordingly.)_",
